# QQQ London Bias Backtester

A local Streamlit backtester for your 5-minute QQQ strategy.

## Included logic
- London session start reference price
- 90-minute London no-trade bias buffer
- Bias must stay valid continuously after the buffer
- Intraday VWAP
- 200 SMA bias filter
- Configurable EMA pullback entries
- Hammer, engulfing, and tweezer patterns
- ATR stop buffer, optional trailing stop, fixed RR target
- Trade log, equity curve, drawdown, weekly and monthly performance

## Local setup
```bash
cd /private/tmp/qqq-backtester-local
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
cp .env.example .env
streamlit run app.py
```
